+<article id="rewards" itemscope itemtype="urn:PrismBreaker:Requirement" data-kind="browser"><h2>Mastery reward recognition</h2><p>Collection entry and retries retain official mastery intent; new medals, first world sets and the final collection earn distinct ceremonies. Ordinary runs retain their story. Failed award saves expose retry. Three ceremony tiers fit phone/landscape/desktop layouts at normal and doubled text, with reduced motion and reachable continuation.</p></article><article id="playback" itemscope itemtype="urn:PrismBreaker:Requirement" data-kind="browser"><h2>Automatic cinematic playback</h2><p>All 16 stories, both record endings, Daily completion and three mastery ceremonies change rendered pixels on the real application clock, in full and low effects. Award-to-story transitions, pause/resume, replay, preparation failure and explicit reduced-motion playback are exercised. No injected timeline values or manual renders count as automatic playback evidence. Local browser evidence does not replace physical-device reproduction.</p></article></main></html>
